  "_comment": [
    "Seed prices for Solo Economy, in emeralds.",
    "",
    "ONLY put primitives here - things you dig, farm, kill or loot for. Anything with a crafting,",
    "smelting or stonecutting recipe is priced automatically from its cheapest recipe path times",
    "craftMarkup, which is what guarantees crafting-to-sell is never profitable.",
    "",
    "Never seed BOTH sides of a recipe (raw_iron AND iron_ingot, cobblestone AND stone). Doing so",
    "bypasses the markup and can open an infinite money loop. Seed the input only.",
    "",
    "Emeralds are the currency, so emeralds and emerald blocks are untradeable - deposit and",
    "withdraw them at the stall at 1:1 instead."
